cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Pluto Scanner in academic work, cite this repository."
title: "Pluto Scanner"
abstract: >-
  Desktop SDR application for ADALM-PLUTO / Pluto+ with spectrum and waterfall
  analysis, software VFO, demodulation, full-range band scanning, JSON
  background comparison, passive drone-band monitoring, IQ evidence clips and
  a local signal-signature library.
authors:
  - name: "Pluto Scanner contributors"
type: software
license: MIT
version: 0.12.0
date-released: "2026-10-31"
keywords:
  - SDR
  - ADALM-PLUTO
  - Pluto+
  - spectrum
  - drone detection
  - RF
